{
  "_comment": "Routine read and development actions that must run without a pause, grouped by class. Every id names a case in benign_false_positive_gate.json, which replays it through the native decision path for each listed harness. 'routine' cases must allow with no approval row; 'floor' cases are the same programs aimed at a write, a foreign target or another home, and must still not allow. A class without a floor case cannot show that its allows leave the safety floor in place.",
